    <string name="fortune_disclaimer" formatted="false">The couplets are by Hafez (public domain); the wording differs slightly between editions. The interpretations are meant for inspiration, not prediction.</string>
    <string name="fortune_history" formatted="false">Previous days</string>
    <string name="fortune_meaning_1" formatted="false">Beginnings can look easy and then reveal their difficulties. Keep going calmly; patience turns a hard start into steady progress.</string>
    <string name="fortune_meaning_10" formatted="false">It is a good day to start something new. Break the old routine and try a fresh plan.</string>
    <string name="fortune_meaning_11" formatted="false">After a setback, hope is the wind that moves you forward. Keep trying; a friendly face may appear.</string>
    <string name="fortune_meaning_12" formatted="false">Humility opens the eyes. Learn from everyone you meet and your vision will become clearer.</string>
    <string name="fortune_meaning_2" formatted="false">A quiet moment of inspiration is near. Notice the small signs today and be grateful for what you have been given.</string>
    <string name="fortune_meaning_3" formatted="false">A hard period is passing. What was lost may return in a new form, so keep hope alive.</string>
    <string name="fortune_meaning_4" formatted="false">Good memories are a source of strength. Reach out to someone you care about today.</string>
    <string name="fortune_meaning_5" formatted="false">What you look for far away may already be within you. Look inward before looking elsewhere.</string>
    <string name="fortune_meaning_6" formatted="false">A message or a reunion may be on its way. Be kind in how you reach out and the answer will be kind too.</string>
    <string name="fortune_meaning_7" formatted="false">Do not let worldly worries tie you down. Free yourself from what drags you and aim higher.</string>
    <string name="fortune_meaning_8" formatted="false">Freedom comes from needing less. Choose one thing to let go of today and notice how light it feels.</string>
    <string name="fortune_meaning_9" formatted="false">Be warm with friends and fair with those who disagree. Good manners solve more than arguments do.</string>
    <string name="fortune_meaning_label" formatted="false">Interpretation</string>
